flowchart LR
    CLIENT[Clients<br/>Python · TypeScript · HTTPS]
    API[Modular API<br/>contracts · idempotency · routing]
    POLICY{Auth + policy<br/>tenant · workspace · deny-first}
    DOMAIN[Memory domains<br/>user · agent · organization]
    DB[(PostgreSQL<br/>canonical versions · grants · outbox)]
    OBJECT[(S3-compatible objects<br/>source documents)]
    WORKER[Independent worker<br/>retry · enrich · index · purge]
    CONTEXT[Context assembly<br/>authorize · hydrate · label · cite]
    RESPONSE[Structured response<br/>warnings · conflicts · degraded status]
    DENY[Denied safely<br/>content-free audit]
    EVIDENCE[Evidence plane<br/>privacy-safe telemetry · versioned evaluations]
    SAFE[Verified controls<br/>zero disclosure · revocation · write-loss regressions<br/>rollback proven]
    BLOCK[PRODUCTION BLOCKED<br/>throughput · latency · index lag · recovery<br/>object bytes · RSS evidence]
    FUTURE[Evidence-gated only<br/>Redis · Kafka · Kubernetes<br/>dedicated vector or graph systems]

    CLIENT --> API --> POLICY
    POLICY -->|authorized| DOMAIN
    POLICY -->|deny| DENY
    DOMAIN -->|canonical write| DB
    DOMAIN -->|document source| OBJECT
    DB -. durable outbox .-> WORKER
    OBJECT -. authorized bytes .-> WORKER
    WORKER -. candidate IDs .-> CONTEXT
    DB -->|current versions| CONTEXT
    DOMAIN -->|read request| CONTEXT
    DB -->|write acknowledgement| RESPONSE
    CONTEXT --> RESPONSE --> CLIENT
    API -. metadata only .-> EVIDENCE
    WORKER -. metadata only .-> EVIDENCE
    EVIDENCE --> SAFE
    EVIDENCE --> BLOCK
    BLOCK -. measured extraction gates only .-> FUTURE

